<title>JAPAN: Toyo Koken - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Koken - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.52		vs	    1.42</p>
<p> Operating	   67    million	  vs	   57    million</p>
<p> Current	     67    million	  vs	   52    million</p>
<p> Net		   18    million	  vs	   19    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.87 yen	  vs	    3.04 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Koken Co Ltd is a top manufacturer of large electric winches for ship loading and construction.</p>
